    "leading": {
      "$comment": "line-height as a UNITLESS multiplier — a web-equivalent of the iOS additive .lineSpacing tokens (AppFonts.LineSpacing). iOS adds N pt of leading on top of the font lineHeight; on web we express comfortable reading ratios. These are platform-equivalent, not a literal mirror.",
